{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"31359","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:31359","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_136939","characterName":"勇往舞神","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"136939","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"322273"},{"characterId":"136939","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"446754"}]},"originalCharacterName":"勇往舞神","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"200"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"156"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"无角人鱼，喜欢的事物是红色水中花。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"6月开始来到豪杰家的人鱼。头脑很聪明，能够理解人类的语言，可以进行高度的交流。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"上半身穿着红色高领衣服，因为她的脖子上有被剜下的伤口，所以用衣领隐藏起来。在感到惊讶或是感叹时会发出“AMIRA（あみら）”的声音。最喜欢唱歌和甜食，如果给她的话会非常高兴。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她过去吃掉了人鱼，一直为此深深后悔着，害怕给人类带来麻烦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"认为爱是无偿·相互的，深爱着无论何时都毫不吝啬地爱着自己的豪杰。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"有关名字：勇往舞神（ゆうおうまいしん）=勇往迈进"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"资料：有关人鱼"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"136939"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b6/b634e2f55ad9b13cc896f2801a715d7eefa174a652fd8803243b7ec59ff7eddc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/92a21cdf1f8223f34cdda9cbc15f1daba6d8d84d1cf11f9278a40147734b401b.webp","width":232,"height":196,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_136940","characterName":"永劫海貴","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"136940","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"322273"},{"characterId":"136940","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"446754"}]},"originalCharacterName":"永劫海貴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0829"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"183"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"灯绯大学生。喜欢的东西是白身鱼肉、培根蛋面（Carbonara）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"三年前，来到豪杰家的大学生。是人鱼博士豪杰的助手兼知音。虽然他的兴趣是调制鸡尾酒，但咖啡也泡得很好喝。他是世界性的UB表演大会上第一个取得四个冠军的日本人，超实力演员。头脑很聪明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他原本对未来没有希望，三年前失去父亲的时候，这种念头更加突出，他对这个世界的一切都抱着放弃的态度。只对一个人——当时支持着他的豪杰，有着绝对的信赖和近乎信仰的感情。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"有关名字：永劫海贵（えいごうかいき）=永劫回归"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"136940"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/46dc16d3b8e9c216d41392097b89c7e1dd454cae5e6179fcf86e938ccf9a51d9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d2d85d040ae0862f34950b729f1371a63fb2475d4031a2c3c09089b5eb2ec60b.webp","width":190,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_136941","characterName":"桜花蘭万","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"136941","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"322273"},{"characterId":"136941","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"446754"}]},"originalCharacterName":"桜花蘭万","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0320"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"164"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"灯绯大学生。喜欢的东西是甜食。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一年前，来到豪杰家寄住的大学生。有一个岁数差很多的，行踪不明的弟弟。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"朋友很多，偶尔会一起玩到晚上，其实是一个非常老实认真的孩子。非常喜欢甜食，逛咖啡店是她的兴趣。此外，还经常购买演艺、时尚类的杂志。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她对于【未知】感到恐惧。内心非常害怕人鱼这一存在。这也有她的性格以及家庭环境的印象。讨厌现在的生活变得崩溃，心爱的家人被伤害，想尽可能地排除导致这种事发生的因素。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"有关名字：樱花兰万（おうからんまん）=樱花烂漫"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"136941"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e4b3343008a81ebd2587bda53f5bb76293688473acd32709e6aa8c51a19cfed.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/043e208667ddd1536c91af0b52531a05dcd93a138df8402994b2f8a7b488bfbd.webp","width":185,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_136942","characterName":"シャニ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"136942","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"322273"},{"characterId":"136942","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"446754"}]},"originalCharacterName":"シャニ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c577d51ae5b7890be7c7946f5e91d6a4a2534ed0908cd5454ddcdf5792e7bace.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/10b1b6f51ec248cfb23b02d96b0ef3fb27d9df3229426308734f7c9d89b1162b.webp","width":176,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_136943","characterName":"セイレン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"136943","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"322273"},{"characterId":"136943","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"446754"}]},"originalCharacterName":"セイレン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex